{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mumu's Soup Adventure SAMSARA is a puzzle story adventure game where you play as a cute ghost cat and explore various settings such as a forest, a school and a mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.poster.avif?t=1752886333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.webm?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.mp4?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles by using items you've found, or observing hints while exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.poster.avif?t=1752886333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.webm?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.mp4?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A different story in each chapter that focuses on the character you've encountered. The stories also contains elements of drama and josei themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.poster.avif?t=1752886333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.webm?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.mp4?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn CG art and world set in a town that mixes modern life with cute fantasy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.poster.avif?t=1752886333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.webm?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877710/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.mp4?t=1752886333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The scent of flowers...it calms me.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mumu is a ghost cat, whose master is Jill, the candy witch with a wicked sweet tooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day,\u00a0Jill decided she wants to make soup, and one of the ingredients is Mumu's heart!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running away from the persistent witch, he also encounters a\u00a0mysterious (and sexy) flower witch, and thus a new duty has begun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Become the overseer of lost souls&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Explore, solve puzzles, and follow Mumu's story in his adventure!</i></strong></h2><p 